    "created_at": "2020-05-19T16:41:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-19T16:41:30Z",
    "body": "While not exactly what you are looking for the ability to modify the configuration from the command line was added in [v0.41.0](https://github.com/starship/starship/releases/tag/v0.41.0) via #1095.\r\n\r\nSo you to enable and disable modules by running a command e.g\r\n```bash\r\n# Disable the kubernetes module\r\nstarship config kubernetes.disabled true\r\n# Enable the kubernetes module\r\nstarship config kubernetes.disabled false\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith a bit of scripting/aliasing this might be a viable alternative for now.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
